+
+config RIGOL_FAMILY_MHO
+	bool "MHO900"
+
+endchoice
+
+config RIGOL_RUNSTOP_WINDOW_MS
+	int "How long U-Boot listens for Run/Stop after the receive FIFO is read (ms)"
+	default 200
+	help
+	  SPL opens the front-panel UART0 at 1,500,000 baud before it loads
+	  U-Boot, so the frames sent from then on wait in the UART's receive
+	  FIFO. U-Boot reads them, then listens this much longer, for a Run/Stop
+	  press or release (FA 08 0C 34 AF or FA 08 00 58 AF) anywhere in the
+	  stream. Either one enters Loader mode (Rockusb).
